.Rhistory
.RData
*.Rout

# ── Third-party reference material (not ours to redistribute) ───────────────
assets/*.pdf
data/jazzpanda/*

# jazzPanda gene-set enrichment (interp/enrichment*, interp/pathway_*.json) is COMMITTED
# for the demo dataset — computed from jazzPanda and shareable, so the Pathways workflow
# runs from a fresh clone. Datasets built without it fall back to the marker-only slice
# (see ui/data_access.py). Only the runtime state below stays local. The raw jazzPanda
# inputs under data/jazzpanda/ remain gitignored; we ship the precomputed artifacts only.

# Summary working-space edits — runtime user state (the biologist's report prose),
# written by the UI as they edit; not a build artifact to commit.
data/studies/*/interp/summary_edits.json

# Sign-off / review state — runtime user state (which calls the biologist reviewed
# and accepted on the Summary board); a sibling of summary_edits, not a build artifact.
data/studies/*/interp/review_state.json

# Chat transcripts — runtime conversation state, persisted so a refresh keeps the
# chat; the durable knowledge is the notes under context/, not this.
data/studies/*/interp/chat_threads.json

# Research profile — the biologist's local research interest, captured at
# onboarding to personalize literature search. Local-only, never committed (privacy).
context/profile.json

# User memory — the biologist's own decisions, distilled and portable across
# projects. Local-only, never committed (privacy), same model as the profile.
context/user_memory.jsonl

# Decision log + correction notes — the biologist's own local lab knowledge,
# written by the UI at runtime (carries author identity + specific calls).
# Local-only, never committed (privacy); a fresh clone starts with an empty layer.
context/decisions/
context/corrections/

# ── Claude Code local state (worktrees, settings) — never commit ────────────
# .claude/worktrees can hold a full repo copy (100s of MB); settings are local.
.claude/

# ── OS / editor cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp

# ── Machine handoff bundle — local only ─────────────────────────────────────
# Carries the Claude memory layer, the registered NCBI email, machine-specific
# paths and secret NAMES. Move it between laptops by AirDrop/USB/private gist,
# never through this public repo.
handoff/

# Demo video source clips (~1.1 GB of .mov; one file is 94 MB, over GitHub's
# 100 MB limit). The shipped demo is the YouTube embed + assets/demo_thumbnail.jpg.
assets/Panoscope demo/
